<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa to Kansai Elec straight bonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa to Kansai Elec straight bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Monday that it had assigned an Aaa rating to Kansai Electric Power Co Inc's 30 billion yen 1.75 percent straight bonds due 2001.</p>
</text>
